OL,3,AJury shown CCTV of train staff using
OL,4,Afrying pan in defence
OL,5,
OL,6,FCCTV footage of a member of train staff
OL,7,Fusing a frying pan to stop a man
OL,8,Faccused of attempting to murder 10
OL,9,Fpassengers has been shown in court.
OL,11,FProsecutor Christopher Paxton KC said
OL,12,FSamir Zitouni showed "sheer courage and
OL,13,Fbravery in seeking to save lives and
OL,14,Fdefend others" during the mass stabbing
OL,15,Fon the Doncaster to King's Cross train.
OL,17,FJurors at Cambridge Crown Court saw
OL,18,Ffootage of Zitouni using the frying pan
OL,19,Fagainst Anthony Williams before the
OL,20,Ftrain made an unscheduled stop at
OL,21,FHuntingdon railway station on 1
OL,22,FNovember last year.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
