OL,3,AJury shown CCTV of train staff using
OL,4,Afrying pan in defence
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliams, 33, of Langford Road in
OL,7,FPeterborough, denies 14 counts of
OL,8,Fattempted murder, including incidents
OL,9,Fin Peterborough and London the day
OL,10,Fbefore.
